        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: National road, AC 22 EME C2 base layer, 50% recycling
Modern Swiss and European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: d3f7b0e1-452d-40a1-9e65-01d97fe187c4
This dataset documents the production, installation, deconstruction and end-of-life treatment of 1 m2 AC 22 EME C2 base layer for national road in Switzerland.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Layer thickness 80 mm, service life 40 years. 50 % recycling content
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d3f7b0e1-452d-40a1-9e65-01d97fe187c4.xml</text>
